WEBVTT

NOTE The trailer has music and no speech. These cues give the sound and repeat the text shown on screen.

00:00.000 --> 00:07.380
[Music]
On screen: “At Basel I founded the Jewish State.” — Theodor Herzl, founder of political Zionism

00:07.380 --> 00:12.920
On screen: “…in fifty, everyone will know it.” — Theodor Herzl

00:20.310 --> 00:25.850
On screen: “At the tender age of sixteen, I was handed a rifle…” — Yitzhak Rabin, Prime Minister of Israel

00:31.380 --> 00:36.920
On screen: “…open for Jewish immigration and for the Ingathering of the Exiles.” — David Ben-Gurion, Declaration of Independence

00:48.000 --> 00:51.690
On screen: “No more war. No more bloodshed.” — Menachem Begin, Prime Minister of Israel

00:51.690 --> 00:55.380
On screen: “Citizens of Israel, we are at war.” — Benjamin Netanyahu, Prime Minister of Israel, 7 October 2023

01:12.000 --> 01:17.540
[Music stops]
On screen: “If you will it, it is no dream.” — Theodor Herzl

01:17.540 --> 01:23.100
[Music]
